---
description: Deployment standards for local, staging, and production.
alwaysApply: true
---

# Deployment

The project must be deployable at any time.

Never introduce deployment-specific hacks.

---

# Environments

Support:

Local

Development

Staging

Production

---

# Configuration

Never hardcode environment values.

Always use environment variables.

---

# Production

Target Platform:

Ubuntu 24.04 LTS

Nginx

HTTPS

Node.js LTS

Go

PostgreSQL

Redis

---

# Build

Production builds must:

Pass linting.

Pass type checking.

Pass tests.

Complete without warnings where possible.

---

# Secrets

Never commit:

.env

API Keys

JWT Secrets

Database credentials

SMTP credentials

---

# Logging

Separate:

Application logs

Access logs

Error logs

Audit logs

---

# Monitoring

Applications should be ready for:

Health checks

Metrics

Structured logging

Future monitoring integration

---

# Backup

Database backups should be scheduled.

Recovery procedures should be documented.

---

# Goal

Deployment should be repeatable,

predictable,

and reliable.